    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n2672" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">αἰσθ-ητός</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ή</span>,
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">όν</span>, and <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ός</span>, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">όν</span>
		<i><span class="en">
			Pl.
			<u>Men.</u>
			76d
		</span></i>; <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>sensible,
			perceptible</i>, opp. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">νοητός</span>,
				<i><span class="en">
				Id.
				<u>Plt.</u>
				285e
